% --- System 1 ---
[V:1] | B | G B | c e | B3/2 A/2 | G || B | E G | A G | F E | F2 ||
[V:2] | F | E E | A G | F D | E || B | E E | E E | D C | D2 ||
[V:3] | B, | B, G, | A, B, | B, B, | B, || B, | G, C | C B, | B, G, | B,2 ||
[V:4] | D, | E, G, | F, E, | D, B,, | E, || D, | C,3/2 B,,/2 | A,, E, | B,, C, | B,,2 ||
% --- System 2 ---
[V:1] | B | G B | c e | B3/2 A/2 | G || B | E G | A G | F F | E2 ||
[V:2] | D | E E | E E | F D | E || D | E G | A G | E D | E2 ||
[V:3] | F, | E, B, | A, G, | F, B, | B, || B, | G, C | C B, | C B, | G,2 ||
[V:4] | B,, | C, G,, | A,, C, | D, B,, | E, || D, | C,3/2 B,,/2 | A,, E, | A,, B,, | E,2 ||

W: 1 Before the ending of the day,
W: Creator of the world, we pray.
W: Your grace and peace to us allow
W: and guard and keep your people now.
W:
W: 2 From evil dreams defend our sight,
W: from all the terrors of the night,
W: from all deluding thoughts that creep
W: on heedless minds disarmed by sleep.
W:
W: 3 O Father, this we ask be done
W: through Jesus Christ, your only Son,
W: whom with the Spirit we adore
W: forever and forever more. Amen.
W:</miscellaneous-field>
